---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — WebP Ninja"
  description="WebP Ninja's privacy policy: we don't upload, store, or see your images. All compression happens locally in your browser."
>
  <Nav />
  <main class="max-w-[760px] mx-auto px-6 py-24">
    <h1 class="text-[32px] font-semibold leading-[40px] tracking-[-1.28px] text-[#171717] mb-8">
      Privacy Policy
    </h1>
    <div class="text-[15px] leading-[24px] text-[#4d4d4d] flex flex-col gap-6">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-[20px] font-semibold text-[#171717] mb-2">No Image Uploads (Browser Tool)</h2>
        <p>
          All image compression on this page happens entirely within your browser using
          the Canvas and WebAssembly APIs. Your images are never uploaded to, transmitted
          to, or stored on any server we operate.
        </p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-[20px] font-semibold text-[#171717] mb-2">Developer API</h2>
        <p>
          The <a href="/docs" class="text-[#b45309] hover:underline">Developer API</a> is a
          separate, opt-in product for developers. Images sent to
          <code class="font-mono text-[13px] bg-[#f5f5f5] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded-[4px]">/api/v1/compress</code>
          are necessarily processed on our servers to perform the compression — this is
          held in memory only for the duration of the request and is never written to
          disk or a database. We also store account data needed to operate the API:
          your Google account email/name, your API key (hashed, not in plain text), and
          a monthly count of compressions for quota enforcement — not the images
          themselves.
        </p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-[20px] font-semibold text-[#171717] mb-2">Analytics</h2>
        <p>
          We use Google Analytics to understand aggregate site usage (such as page views
          and traffic sources) and improve the site. Google Analytics uses cookies and
          collects information such as your IP address, browser, device, and pages
          visited. This data is processed by Google as described in
          <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" class="text-[#b45309] hover:underline">Google's privacy policy</a>.
          We do not use this data to identify you personally, and it is never linked to
          any images you compress.
        </p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-[20px] font-semibold text-[#171717] mb-2">Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p>
          This site loads fonts from Google Fonts, which may collect standard request
          data (such as IP address) as described in
          <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" class="text-[#b45309] hover:underline">Google's privacy policy</a>.
          The homepage displays an aggregate, site-wide counter of total images
          compressed; submitting the counter increments a shared number only and
          contains no image data or personal information. Our contact form is
          processed by Google Apps Script, which stores the name, email, subject,
          and message you submit so we can reply to you. Signing in to the
          <a href="/dashboard" class="text-[#b45309] hover:underline">Developer API dashboard</a>
          uses Google Sign-In, which shares your name, email, and profile photo with us.
          Paid plan purchases are processed by
          <a href="https://razorpay.com/privacy/" class="text-[#b45309] hover:underline">Razorpay</a>,
          which handles your payment details directly — we never see or store your card
          or bank information.
        </p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-[20px] font-semibold text-[#171717] mb-2">Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this policy from time to time. Continued use of the site
          constitutes acceptance of any changes.
        </p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-[20px] font-semibold text-[#171717] mb-2">Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Questions about this policy can be sent to
          <a href="mailto:hello@webpninja.com" class="text-[#b45309] hover:underline">hello@webpninja.com</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
